.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Extends \fBILock<T>\fP with spin‑lock‑specific diagnostics and metadata\&. Implementations of \fBISpinlock<T>\fP represent busy‑wait mutual exclusion primitives where threads repeatedly attempt to acquire the lock without yielding\&. 

This interface exposes additional state information commonly associated with spin locks, such as whether the lock is currently held and whether the calling thread owns the lock\&.

.PP
